Procedure:
Define the main task.
Divide the task into smaller sub-tasks.
Create a hierarchy using the MAXQ framework.
Learn policies for individual sub-tasks.
Combine the sub-task policies.
Execute the complete task.
Evaluate the performance.
Experiment 18 – Multi-Agent RL
Procedure:
Create multiple agents in the environment.
Define their states, actions, and rewards.
Allow the agents to interact with the environment.
Agents learn from their experiences.
Update their policies.
Repeat the training process.
Evaluate cooperation or competition between agents.
Experiment 19 – POMDP
Procedure:
Define the partially observable environment.
Define possible states, actions, and observations.
Initialize the agent's belief about the environment.
Select an action using the available observation.
Receive a new observation and reward.
Update the belief/state estimate.
Repeat and evaluate decision-making.
